#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:13939
msgid "The %s line in wp-config.php is not the one WordPress runs with, so it can only be changed there."
msgstr "Baris %s di wp-config.php bukan baris yang dipakai WordPress saat berjalan, jadi hanya dapat diubah di sana."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:13951
msgid "The change would break wp-config.php, so it was not saved."
